<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  iOS launch screen — the static half of option (a) in the Workstream O hand-off (1a).

  This covers the pre-render window, which O-0's Time Profiler trace measured at ~158 ms of
  FRUSExplorerApp.init() alone — 137 ms of it a synchronous SwiftData store open with
  nothing in it to delete. No SwiftUI overlay can draw there, because it is before the first
  frame; only a launch screen can, and until #529 this was `UILaunchScreen: {}` — blank white.

  A launch screen runs NO code: no gradients, no SF Symbol tinting, no Dynamic Type. So the
  colours come from the asset catalog so light and dark both work, the two labels use fixed
  system-font sizes taken from the hand-off, and both images are pre-rendered:

  - LaunchAppTile is THE APP ICON — the same 1024 pt artwork the home screen shows, clipped to
    the home screen's continuous corner and rasterised at 1x/2x/3x (a `mac` idiom carries the
    macOS icon for LaunchSplashView, which draws the same block once SwiftUI is running). ON
    iPAD IT IS 176 pt, the wordmark 28 and the caption 15: the regular-width, regular-height
    size-class variations below, which is iPad and nothing else — 88 pt was 22% of a phone's
    width and 10% of an iPad's. The three numbers are LaunchIdentityMetrics.pad; keep them in
    step. It
    used to be a generic blue document-and-magnifier tile that appeared nowhere else in the
    product, so the first frame a reader saw was not the icon they had just tapped. The splash
    draws the same icon on a Liquid Glass backplate; that plate is a live effect over the cloud
    and cannot be drawn here, so it arrives with the splash rather than being faked in the PNG.

  - LaunchCloud is the word cloud the splash then animates: a square plate packed by the app's
    own WordCloudLayout from cloud-vectors-core.json on the `.concepts` lens, generated by
    FRUSExplorerTests/LaunchArtworkTests behind RENDER_LAUNCH_ARTWORK_DIR. Its weight lives in
    its ALPHA channel, so its two appearance variants differ only in the ink; it ships per IDIOM,
    because aspect-fill magnifies a square plate more on a narrow device and the centre it must
    keep clear for the identity block is correspondingly larger. The catalog carries PNG
    RENDITIONS at or under 2400 px on an edge, never the PDF: a 4200 px rendition (what actool
    makes of a 1400 pt PDF at 3x) drew this whole screen BLACK on iPad and iPhone alike, and a
    2400 px one draws it. Until the plate existed the
    launch screen drew a bare tile on an empty field, so the handover to LaunchSplashView was a
    blank screen replaced by a full one — and on iPad it was an 88 pt tile lost in 1210 pt of
    near-white, because this composition is authored at iPhone size (the `retina6_12` device
    below) and merely centred on everything larger.

  A NEW OR CHANGED IMAGE HERE NEEDS THE SIMULATOR REBOOTED, NOT JUST THE APP REINSTALLED.
  Measured 2026-09-20 on iPad Pro 11-inch (M5) / iOS 27.0: seven freshly added assets — a
  byte-identical copy of LaunchAppTile under a new name among them — drew nothing after
  uninstall + reinstall, while LaunchAppTile drew in the same frame; after shutdown + boot +
  reinstall, and on a never-used device, all seven drew. The launch-screen renderer keeps the
  app's asset catalog in memory per bundle identifier, and a reinstall does not evict it. This
  is what PR #1346 recorded as an unexplained lookup failure and reverted the plate over: every
  configuration it "eliminated" was tested on a device holding the stale catalog.

  Keep this composition in step with LaunchSplashView's: the two are meant to read as one
  moment, not as a screen replaced by a different screen.

  This supersedes the visual-marketing plan's refusal 11 ("do not put any image beyond the
  existing dim tile"), whose stated reason — no code, cached snapshot — argues against a DYNAMIC
  launch screen and not against a better static one. Owner decision, 2026-09-20.
-->
<document type="com.apple.InterfaceBuilder3.CocoaTouch.Storyboard.XIB" version="3.0" toolsVersion="22505" targetRuntime="iOS.CocoaTouch" propertyAccessControl="none" useAutolayout="YES" launchScreen="YES" useTraitCollections="YES" useSafeAreas="YES" colorMatched="YES" initialViewController="01J-lp-oVM">
    <device id="retina6_12" orientation="portrait" appearance="light"/>
    <dependencies>
        <plugIn identifier="com.apple.InterfaceBuilder.IBCocoaTouchPlugin" version="22504"/>
        <capability name="Safe area layout guides" minToolsVersion="9.0"/>
        <capability name="documents saved in the Xcode 8 format" minToolsVersion="8.0"/>
    </dependencies>
    <scenes>
        <scene sceneID="EHf-IW-A2E">
            <objects>
                <viewController id="01J-lp-oVM" sceneMemberID="viewController">
                    <view key="view" contentMode="scaleToFill" id="Ze5-6b-2t3">
                        <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="0.0" width="393" height="852"/>
                        <autoresizingMask key="autoresizingMask" widthSizable="YES" heightSizable="YES"/>
                        <subviews>
                            <imageView clipsSubviews="YES" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="scaleAspectFill" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" image="LaunchCloud" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="img-cloud-aaa">
                                <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="0.0" width="393" height="852"/>
                            </imageView>
                            <stackView opaque="NO" contentMode="scaleToFill" axis="vertical" alignment="center" spacing="14" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="stk-01-aaa">
                                <rect key="frame" x="36" y="352" width="321" height="149"/>
                                <subviews>
                                    <imageView clipsSubviews="YES" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="scaleAspectFit" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" image="LaunchAppTile" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="img-01-aaa">
                                        <rect key="frame" x="116.5" y="0.0" width="88" height="88"/>
                                        <constraints>
                                            <constraint firstAttribute="width" constant="88" id="img-w-aaa">
                                                <variation key="heightClass=regular-widthClass=regular" constant="176"/>
                                            </constraint>
                                            <constraint firstAttribute="height" constant="88" id="img-h-aaa">
                                                <variation key="heightClass=regular-widthClass=regular" constant="176"/>
                                            </constraint>
                                        </constraints>
                                    </imageView>
                                    <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" text="FRUS Explorer" textAlignment="center" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="lbl-t-aaa">
                                        <rect key="frame" x="105" y="104" width="111" height="26"/>
                                        <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" weight="semibold" pointSize="22"/>
                                        <color key="textColor" name="LaunchTitle"/>
                                        <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                        <variation key="heightClass=regular-widthClass=regular">
                                            <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" weight="semibold" pointSize="28"/>
                                        </variation>
                                    </label>
                                    <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" text="Foreign Relations of the United States · since 1861" textAlignment="center" lineBreakMode="wordWrap" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="lbl-c-aaa">
                                        <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="138" width="321" height="16"/>
                                        <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" pointSize="13"/>
                                        <color key="textColor" name="LaunchCaption"/>
                                        <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                        <variation key="heightClass=regular-widthClass=regular">
                                            <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" pointSize="15"/>
                                        </variation>
                                    </label>
                                </subviews>
                            </stackView>
                        </subviews>
                        <viewLayoutGuide key="safeArea" id="6Tk-OE-BBY"/>
                        <color key="backgroundColor" name="LaunchBackground"/>
                        <constraints>
                            <constraint firstItem="img-cloud-aaa" firstAttribute="top" secondItem="Ze5-6b-2t3" secondAttribute="top" id="cst-clt-aaa"/>
                            <constraint firstItem="img-cloud-aaa" firstAttribute="leading" secondItem="Ze5-6b-2t3" secondAttribute="leading" id="cst-cll-aaa"/>
                            <constraint firstAttribute="trailing" secondItem="img-cloud-aaa" secondAttribute="trailing" id="cst-clr-aaa"/>
                            <constraint firstAttribute="bottom" secondItem="img-cloud-aaa" secondAttribute="bottom" id="cst-clb-aaa"/>
                            <constraint firstItem="stk-01-aaa" firstAttribute="centerX" secondItem="6Tk-OE-BBY" secondAttribute="centerX" id="cst-cx-aaa"/>
                            <constraint firstItem="stk-01-aaa" firstAttribute="centerY" secondItem="6Tk-OE-BBY" secondAttribute="centerY" id="cst-cy-aaa"/>
                            <constraint firstItem="stk-01-aaa" firstAttribute="leading" secondItem="6Tk-OE-BBY" secondAttribute="leading" constant="36" id="cst-ld-aaa"/>
                            <constraint firstAttribute="trailing" secondItem="stk-01-aaa" secondAttribute="trailing" constant="36" id="cst-tr-aaa"/>
                        </constraints>
                    </view>
                </viewController>
                <placeholder placeholderIdentifier="IBFirstResponder" id="iYj-Kq-Ea1" userLabel="First Responder" sceneMemberID="firstResponder"/>
            </objects>
            <point key="canvasLocation" x="53" y="375"/>
        </scene>
    </scenes>
    <resources>
        <image name="LaunchAppTile" width="88" height="88"/>
        <image name="LaunchCloud" width="1400" height="1400"/>
        <namedColor name="LaunchBackground">
            <color red="0.94899999999999995" green="0.94899999999999995" blue="0.95699999999999996" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
        </namedColor>
        <namedColor name="LaunchCaption">
            <color red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="0.45000000000000001" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
        </namedColor>
        <namedColor name="LaunchTitle">
            <color red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="0.90000000000000002" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
        </namedColor>
    </resources>
</document>
